     "body": "<p>The behavior you see here is expected, given the SPARQL query you list. That is, the SPARQL query listed here will not delete the triple. Instead, I suspect you mean either of these queries:</p>\n\n<p>DELETE WHERE </p>\n{ &lt;&gt; dc:title ?title }\n\n<p>or</p>\n\n<p>DELETE </p>\n{ &lt;&gt; dc:title ?title }\n<p>WHERE </p>\n{ &lt;&gt; dc:title ?title }\n\n<p>Both of those queries will remove the title, whether it contains a \"/\" or not.</p>",
     "created": "15/Jan/16 6:25 PM",
     "id": "16012",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11774/comment/16012",
